## 9. Monthly Sales Analysis

Monthly sales performance:

| Month | Orders | Total Sales |
|---|---:|---:|
| 2025-01 | 76 | ₹10,096,190.73 |
| 2025-02 | 86 | ₹11,511,181.46 |
| 2025-03 | 89 | ₹13,059,899.94 |
